{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0503-next-greater-element-ii","title":"LeetCode 503 下一个更大元素 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0503-next-greater-element-ii","wordCount":878,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-503-下一个更大元素-ii\">LeetCode 503 下一个更大元素 II</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个循环数组 <code>nums</code>（<code>nums[nums.length - 1]</code> 的下一个元素是 <code>nums[0]</code>），返回 <code>nums</code> 中每个元素的下一个更大元素。</p>\n<p>数字 <code>x</code> 的下一个更大元素是按数组遍历顺序，这个数字之后的第一个比它更大的数，这意味着你应该循环地搜索它的下一个更大的数。如果不存在，则输出 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,2,1]&#10;输出：[2,-1,2]&#10;解释：第一个 1 的下一个更大元素是 2；&#10;      2 没有下一个更大元素；&#10;      第二个 1 的下一个更大元素需要循环搜索，找到 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,2,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2,-1,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：第一个 1 的下一个更大元素是 2；</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      2 没有下一个更大元素；</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      第二个 1 的下一个更大元素需要循环搜索，找到 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,2,3,4,3]&#10;输出：[2,3,4,-1,4]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,2,3,4,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2,3,4,-1,4]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是 LC 496 的进阶版本，数组从线性变为循环。核心的单调栈思想不变，关键在于如何处理循环数组的边界问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>循环数组的处理技巧</strong></p>\n<p>处理循环数组最经典的方法是<strong>将数组复制一份拼接在后面</strong>，即将 <code>[a, b, c]</code> 视为 <code>[a, b, c, a, b, c]</code>。这样从任意位置开始向右遍历都能覆盖整个循环。在实现时不需要真正创建新数组，只需要遍历 <code>2n</code> 次并对下标取模即可。</p>\n<p><strong>算法流程</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始化结果数组为全 <code>-1</code></li>\n<li>维护一个单调递减栈，存储数组下标</li>\n<li>遍历 <code>i</code> 从 <code>0</code> 到 <code>2n - 1</code>：<ul>\n<li>实际下标为 <code>i % n</code></li>\n<li>当栈非空且当前元素大于栈顶对应元素时，弹出栈顶并记录答案</li>\n<li>只在第一轮（<code>i &lt; n</code>）时将下标入栈</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第二轮遍历不需要入栈，因为第二轮的元素已经在第一轮中处理过了。第二轮的作用仅仅是为第一轮中还留在栈里的元素提供&quot;循环&quot;后的更大值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>LC 496 下一个更大元素 I</th>\n<th>LC 503 下一个更大元素 II</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数组类型</td>\n<td>线性数组</td>\n<td>循环数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历次数</td>\n<td>1 次</td>\n<td>2 次（模拟循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元素唯一</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询方式</td>\n<td>哈希表映射</td>\n<td>直接按下标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间存储</td>\n<td>值 → 值映射</td>\n<td>下标 → 值映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function nextGreaterElements(nums: number[]): number[] {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const result = new Array(n).fill(-1);&#10;  const stack: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 2 * n; i++) {&#10;    const current = nums[i % n];&#10;    while (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; current &gt; nums[stack[stack.length - 1]]) {&#10;      const idx = stack.pop()!;&#10;      result[idx] = current;&#10;    }&#10;    if (i &lt; n) {&#10;      stack.push(i);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nextGreaterElements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result[idx] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用示例 2 模拟过程帮助理解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"nums = [1, 2, 3, 4, 3]，n = 5&#10;&#10;第一轮 (i=0..4)：&#10;i=0: 入栈 [0]                                    栈温: [1]&#10;i=1: 2&gt;1, 弹出0, result[0]=2; 入栈 [1]           栈温: [2]&#10;i=2: 3&gt;2, 弹出1, result[1]=3; 入栈 [2]           栈温: [3]&#10;i=3: 4&gt;3, 弹出2, result[2]=4; 入栈 [3]           栈温: [4]&#10;i=4: 3&lt;4, 入栈 [3,4]                             栈温: [4,3]&#10;&#10;第二轮 (i=5..9)：&#10;i=5(→0): 1&lt;3, 不弹出，不入栈&#10;i=6(→1): 2&lt;3, 不弹出，不入栈&#10;i=7(→2): 3=3, 不弹出，不入栈&#10;i=8(→3): 4&gt;3, 弹出4, result[4]=4; 4=4不弹出      栈温: [4]&#10;i=9(→4): 3&lt;4, 不弹出，不入栈&#10;&#10;最终：result = [2, 3, 4, -1, 4]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nums = [1, 2, 3, 4, 3]，n = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第一轮 (i=0..4)：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=0: 入栈 [0]                                    栈温: [1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=1: 2>1, 弹出0, result[0]=2; 入栈 [1]           栈温: [2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=2: 3>2, 弹出1, result[1]=3; 入栈 [2]           栈温: [3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=3: 4>3, 弹出2, result[2]=4; 入栈 [3]           栈温: [4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=4: 3&#x3C;4, 入栈 [3,4]                             栈温: [4,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第二轮 (i=5..9)：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=5(→0): 1&#x3C;3, 不弹出，不入栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=6(→1): 2&#x3C;3, 不弹出，不入栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=7(→2): 3=3, 不弹出，不入栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=8(→3): 4>3, 弹出4, result[4]=4; 4=4不弹出      栈温: [4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i=9(→4): 3&#x3C;4, 不弹出，不入栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最终：result = [2, 3, 4, -1, 4]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意在第二轮中，<code>nums[3]=4</code> 作为全局最大值始终留在栈中，其结果保持 <code>-1</code>。这是正确的——循环数组中最大元素没有&quot;下一个更大元素&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>另一种实现方式</strong> 是从后向前遍历两轮，这在某些场景下更直观：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function nextGreaterElementsReverse(nums: number[]): number[] {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const result = new Array(n).fill(-1);&#10;  const stack: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 2 * n - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    const idx = i % n;&#10;    while (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; stack[stack.length - 1] &lt;= nums[idx]) {&#10;      stack.pop();&#10;    }&#10;    if (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; i &lt; n) {&#10;      result[idx] = stack[stack.length - 1];&#10;    }&#10;    stack.push(nums[idx]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nextGreaterElementsReverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[idx]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result[idx] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums[idx]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种方式的时间和空间复杂度相同，选择哪种取决于个人习惯。从前向后遍历在弹出时记录答案（&quot;被解决&quot;视角），从后向前遍历在查看栈顶时记录答案（&quot;主动查找&quot;视角）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>遍历 2n 次，每个元素最多入栈出栈各一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>栈最大深度为 n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 虽然遍历了 <code>2n</code> 次，但每个元素只在第一轮入栈一次、最多出栈一次。第二轮只是触发弹出操作，不会增加入栈操作。因此总操作次数仍为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 栈中只存储第一轮的下标（最多 n 个）。结果数组通常不计入额外空间。在最差情况下（数组严格递减），第一轮结束后栈中有 n 个元素。</p>\n<p><strong>循环数组技巧总结：</strong> 遍历 <code>2n</code> 次 + 取模是处理循环数组的通用技巧。这个技巧不仅用于单调栈，在循环队列、约瑟夫环等问题中也有广泛应用。掌握这个模式后，遇到&quot;循环&quot;相关的变体问题都可以用类似方法处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 503 下一个更大元素 II","id":"leetcode-503-下一个更大元素-ii"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 496 下一个更大元素 I","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0496-next-greater-element"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 907 子数组的最小值之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0907-sum-of-subarray-minimums"}}